[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 302.95, "timestamp": "00:05:02", "text": "我很久以前制作的片头动画之类的东西，对吧？   就是这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 306.39, "timestamp": "00:05:06", "text": "东西，对吧？ 所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 309.67, "timestamp": "00:05:09", "text": "Mel的问题在于，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 320.07, "timestamp": "00:05:20", "text": "如果你没有专注于某个场景，你就无法关闭该媒体文件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 322.39, "timestamp": "00:05:22", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 324.31, "timestamp": "00:05:24", "text": "呃，是啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 329.029, "timestamp": "00:05:29", "text": "，真是太糟糕了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 332.79, "timestamp": "00:05:32", "text": "而且我的电脑运行缓慢，我觉得是因为这个原因，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 335.35, "timestamp": "00:05:35", "text": "但我也不确定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 338.31, "timestamp": "00:05:38", "text": "兄弟，我竟然收集到了我们生命中的3万枚硬币"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 340.469, "timestamp": "00:05:40", "text": "。 我应该买哪个英雄？ 由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 344.15, "timestamp": "00:05:44", "text": "你决定。 喜欢谁就去追吧。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 346.87, "timestamp": "00:05:46", "text": "会说是新角色，他是个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 352.15, "timestamp": "00:05:52", "text": "治疗者。 呃，她只是收集"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 355.11, "timestamp": "00:05:55", "text": "世界各地的物品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 359.43, "timestamp": "00:05:59", "text": "世界物品。 呃，就是那个盒子状的东西。"}]